    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i started taking warfarin recently for my heart rhythm stuff but i've been feeling really down and unmotivated lately. my friend told me st johns wort is amazing for mood and is all natural so i was thinking of adding it to my routine. is that okay to take with my meds?",
